      {
        "name": "places/ChIJLwHpVJ8BBDQRHbyBCn0AF04/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5UVRYTklPVTFZWXpSdE5YaFNhRXRyTmtvNFdsRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "驚喜車仔麵\n選了十餸招牌面，湯底濃稠，每樣餸都各有風味，唔係單一鹵水味道，連朋友嘅菜底都絕不馬虎，煮到剛好。小食推介炸腐皮韭菜🌟\n環境亦舒適，唔會太迫，價錢合理，整體都十分高質🫰\nI ordered the signature noodles with ten different toppings. The broth was rich and thick, and each topping had its own unique flavor—definitely not just a single braised taste. Even the vegetables my friend ordered were prepared with care and cooked to perfection. I highly recommend the fried beancurd skin with chives as a snack 🌟.\nThe environment was comfortable—not too cramped—and the prices were reasonable. Overall, the quality was excellent and I had a very satisfying dining\nexperience 🫰.\n#pet-friendly outdoor seating",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
